# Raw runs, captures and build output stay out of the repository: the distilled
# artifact under evidence/ is what gets committed. These are this project's
# generated paths; docs/REFERENCE.md names the same set.

# Fetched upstream tree, patched by tools/fetch-upstream.sh. Never committed and
# never edited: changes live in patches/. A manually extracted tarball next to
# the repository root is ignored under its own name too. The committed baseline
# in reference/ is not covered by this rule and is always tracked.
vendor/
RetroArch-*/

# Cross-build output and the staged title folder.
build/
dist/

# Fetched dependencies (host test framework, graphics SDK packages).
.deps/

# Raw console captures. The distilled record under evidence/ is what is kept.
klog/

# Payload and library artifacts, staged or loose.
*.elf
*.so
*.prx

# Local console address and credentials.
.env

# Editor and host noise.
*.o
*.a
__pycache__/
*.pyc
